This is a comprehensive audit of the Niraa E-Commerce Platform. After a deep dive into your codebase, I have identified several critical vulnerabilities and architectural flaws that must be addressed before this project can safely transition to a real-world production environment.

I have organized my findings into Security, Scalability/Performance, and Architectural Improvements.

